Call mcp__arm__replay to obtain the compiled functions' outputs for the finite
domain and the Lean theorem signatures that certify them. The checker will
import ReplayFacts when the tool succeeds. Use the returned equalities to
rewrite machineSum and machineBound to the finite tables, then prove the
sensitivity inequality or give a concrete refutation. Use decide for small
closed facts about the tables and the specification. The tool checks compiled
function behavior only. Your candidate theorem must establish the verdict.
